## Testing Checklist (3 weeks)

**Week 1: Core Logic**
- [ ] Unit tests: idempotent callback handling
- [ ] Unit tests: payment allocation logic
- [ ] Test duplicate callback scenarios

**Week 2: Integration**
- [ ] Mock M-Pesa callbacks with duplicate IDs
- [ ] Verify no double-credits
- [ ] Test queue retry logic
- [ ] Test reconciliation cron

**Week 3: Load & Deployment**
- [ ] Load test: 100 callbacks/min
- [ ] Deploy to staging, test zero-downtime deploy
- [ ] Canary deploy to production (10% traffic)
- [ ] Monitor for 48 hours

