## Why This Works

| Constraint | Solution |
|-----------|----------|
| **2% lost callbacks** | Reconciliation cron queries M-Pesa API every 5 min |
| **15-min SLA** | Async job processes in <30s; manual review flagged immediately |
| **No double-credits** | Unique constraint on `mpesa_transaction_id` + idempotent job logic |
| **Zero budget** | Uses existing Laravel queue (database driver), no new services |
| **2 devs, 3 weeks** | Straightforward Laravel patterns; mostly config & testing |

**Expected outcome:** 99.8%+ allocation within 15 minutes; remaining 0.2% flagged for manual review.
